48) ; Esri ArcGIS 13.6.3.59530</envirDesc><dataLang><languageCode value="eng" country="USA"/><countryCode value="USA" Sync="TRUE"/></dataLang><idCitation><resTitle Sync="FALSE">Level 3 Parcels - Taxable Property Boundaries (with ASSESS records added, excluding rights-of-way and water features with null PROP_ID)</resTitle><presForm><PresFormCd value="005"/></presForm><citRespParty><rpOrgName>MassGIS</rpOrgName><rpCntInfo><cntAddress><delPoint>One Ashburton Place, Room 819</delPoint><city>Boston</city><adminArea>MA</adminArea><postCode>02108</postCode><country>USA</country></cntAddress><cntPhone><voiceNum>617-619-5615</voiceNum></cntPhone></rpCntInfo><role><RoleCd value="006"/></role></citRespParty><date><pubDate>20260721</pubDate></date></idCitation><descKeys><thesaName uuidref="723f6998-058e-11dc-8314-0800200c9a66"/><keyword Sync="TRUE">002</keyword></descKeys><spatRpType><SpatRepTypCd value="001"/></spatRpType><dataExt><geoEle xmlns=""><GeoBndBox esriExtentType="search"><westBL Sync="TRUE">-73.533318</westBL><eastBL Sync="TRUE">-69.899292</eastBL><northBL Sync="TRUE">42.888310</northBL><southBL Sync="TRUE">41.230537</southBL><exTypeCode Sync="TRUE">1</exTypeCode></GeoBndBox></geoEle></dataExt><idPurp>This feature class is an export of the spatial view GISDATA.L3_TAXPAR_POLY_ASSESS_SV_ALL, which links L3_TAXPAR_POLY and L3_ASSESS. The export includes the expression: 

(POLY_TYPE IN ('FEE', 'TAX')) OR (POLY_TYPE IN ('ROW', 'PRIV_ROW', 'RAIL_ROW', 'WATER') AND PROP_ID IS NOT NULL)

It contains several fields from GISDATA.L3_ASSESS and stacked polygons where multiple assessor records link to a parcel. It contains features that do not have an associated record in GISDATA.L3_ASSESS, except for rights of way and water bodies. ROWs and water bodies with a non-null PROP_ID are included. This feature class is used for MuniMapper and the L3 Parcels cached tileset that appears in Oliver and other MassGIS online mapping applications.</idPurp><idAbs>&lt;DIV STYLE="text-align:Left;"&gt;&lt;DIV&gt;&lt;DIV&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;MassGIS' Level 3 Assessors’ Parcel Mapping data set was developed through a competitive procurement funded by MassGIS. Each community in the Commonwealth was bid on by one or more vendors and the unit of work awarded was a city or town. The specification for this work was Level 3 of the MassGIS &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;A href="http://www.mass.gov/anf/research-and-tech/it-serv-and-support/application-serv/office-of-geographic-information-massgis/standards/standard-parcels.html" STYLE="text-decoration:underline;"&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;Digital Parcel Standard&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;. Standardization of assessor parcel mapping is complete for 350 of Massachusetts' 351 cities and towns. (Boston, which is not part of this project, is being processed separately). MassGIS is now incorporating updates from municipalities into the database.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;</idAbs><idCredit>Commonwealth of Massachusetts Office of Geographic Information (MassGIS)</idCredit><searchKeys><keyword>Tax assessor parcels</keyword></searchKeys><resConst><Consts><useLimit>&lt;DIV STYLE="text-align:Left;"&gt;&lt;DIV&gt;&lt;DIV&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;None&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;</useLimit></Consts></resConst><resMaint><maintFreq><MaintFreqCd value="009"/></maintFreq><maintScp><ScopeCd value="005"/></maintScp></resMaint><dataChar><CharSetCd value="004"/></dataChar><idStatus><ProgCd value="004"/></idStatus><resConst><LegConsts><useLimit>Assessor’s parcel mapping is a representation of property boundaries, not an authoritative source.  The authoritative record of property boundaries is recorded at the registries of deeds and a legally authoritative map of property boundaries can only be produced by a professional land surveyor.</useLimit></LegConsts></resConst><idPoC><rpOrgName>MassGIS</rpOrgName><rpCntInfo><cntAddress><delPoint>One Ashburton Place, Room 819</delPoint><city>Boston</city><adminArea>MA</adminArea><postCode>02108</postCode><country>USA</country></cntAddress><cntPhone><voiceNum>617-619-5615</voiceNum></cntPhone></rpCntInfo><role><RoleCd value="006"/></role><displayName>MassGIS</displayName></idPoC><tpCat><TopicCatCd value="015"/></tpCat><tpCat><TopicCatCd value="003"/></tpCat></dataIdInfo><mdLang><languageCode value="eng"/><countryCode value="USA" Sync="TRUE"/></mdLang><distInfo><distFormat><formatName Sync="TRUE">Shapefile</formatName><formatVer>ArcGIS 10</formatVer></distFormat><distributor><distorCont><rpOrgName>MassGIS</rpOrgName><rpCntInfo><cntAddress addressType="both"><delPoint>One Ashburton Place, Room 819</delPoint><city>Boston</city><adminArea>MA</adminArea><postCode>02108</postCode><country>USA</country></cntAddress><cntPhone><voiceNum>617-619-5615</voiceNum></cntPhone></rpCntInfo><role><RoleCd value="005"/></role></distorCont><distorFormat><formatName>Shapefile and Geodatabase</formatName><formatVer>ArcGIS 10</formatVer></distorFormat><distorOrdPrc><ordInstr>Download from http://www.mass.gov/mgis/ftpL3parcels.htm</ordInstr></distorOrdPrc></distributor><distTranOps><transSize Sync="TRUE">0.000</transSize></distTranOps></distInfo><mdHrLv><ScopeCd value="005"/></mdHrLv><mdHrLvName Sync="TRUE">dataset</mdHrLvName><refSysInfo><RefSystem><refSysID><identCode code="26986"/><idCodeSpace Sync="TRUE">EPSG</idCodeSpace><idVersion Sync="TRUE">2.1(3.0.1)</idVersion></refSysID></RefSystem></refSysInfo><spdoinfo><direct>Vector</direct><ptvctinf><esrit